# Force LF regardless of this machine's system-wide core.autocrlf=true
# (Git for Windows' default). Without this, checked-out Dockerfiles'
# heredocs (`RUN bash <<'EOF' ... EOF`) get a literal \r baked into every
# line, which corrupts things like `git clone <url>` inside the container
# ("Malformed input to a URL function") — found the hard way on the first
# real docker build (2026-09-12).
* text=auto eol=lf
